Ticket #4471 merged 412 reports of dates landing on the wrong day. Analysis identified two distinct problems, both of which the desk has now resolved.

## The problems

### #71 · Parser reads MM/DD for all locales — 414 reports

The date parser unconditionally interpreted dates as MM/DD without respecting locale. **Fixed in commit `fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales`.**

### #72 · Form hint displays MM/DD for day-first tenants — 13 reports

Booking-v3 form displayed MM/DD/YYYY hint, confusing users in day-first locales. **Won't fix: form has been retired.**

## Status

Closed 5 October. Both problems resolved.
